# API tests

- Prefer the `api-test-author` skill when creating new API coverage.
- Put shared paths/models in `fixtures/endpoints/` and `fixtures/models/`; import them—do not duplicate payloads.
- Add **both** Cypress (`cypress/tests/api/*.cy.ts`) and Playwright (`playwright/api/*.spec.ts`) unless the user names one framework.
- Do not hardcode seed user UUIDs; assert id is a non-empty string or omit it from expected models.
- Seed users: `customer@marlow.test` / `admin@marlow.test` / `staff@marlow.test`, password `datalab`.

## Cypress

- Exact keys: `.to.have.all.keys(...)`
- Partial match: `.to.include(partial)`
- Prefer `.not.equal("")` over `.empty` (eslint unused-expressions)

## Playwright

- Exact keys: sorted `Object.keys(...)`
- Partial match: `toMatchObject`
- Use the `request` fixture (not `page`) for pure API specs
